00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.480 line:78%
COLONEL, GREAT TO SEE YOU THIS

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.181 line:78%
EVENING.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.182 line:78%
