00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.850 line:78%
TODAY WHEN IT COMES TO RUSSIA

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:19.119 line:78%
AND UKRAINE.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.654 line:78%
WHAT SHOULD WE MAKE OF IT?

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:25.692 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, NOT QUITE WHAT SENATOR

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:27.027 line:78%
GRAHAM HAD TO SAY, OR FOR THAT

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.361 line:78%
MATTER PRESIDENT BIDEN.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:30.463 line:78%
THE DESTRUCTION OF THE PIPELINE

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.797 line:78%
WAS CLEARLY NOT EXECUTED BY

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.564 line:78%
RUSSIA.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:34.300 line:78%
NO ONE BELIEVES THAT.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:35.101 line:78%
IN FACT THE GERMAN POPULATION IS

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.369 line:78%
BEING POLLED.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.038 line:78%
OVERWHELMING IS OPPOSED TO THE

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.973 line:78%
NOTION OF ANY WAR WITH RUSSIA

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:41.941 line:78%
AND DISMISSES OUT OF HAND THE

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.176 line:78%
NOTION THAT THE RUSSIANS ARE

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.744 line:78%
RESPONSIBLE FOR THE PIPELINE.

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.879 line:78%
I THINK THREE THINGS ARE WHAT

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.814 line:78%
WE'RE DEALING WITH RIGHT NOW.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:49.349 line:78%
FIRST OF ALL, PUTIN HAS DECIDED

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.850 line:78%
