00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.219 line:78%
HE KNOWS THAT WASHINGTON IS

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.655 line:78%
ULTIMATELY IN CONTROL.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:57.323 line:78%
AND SO HE'S DECIDED THAT IF

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:58.224 line:78%
RESPONSE HE'S GOT TO ESCALATE

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.426 line:78%
THE MILITARY OPERATION.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.294 line:78%
PEOPLE AREN'T AWARE OF IT IN THE

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.328 line:78%
WEST, BUT THE RUSSIAN FORCES IN

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.230 line:78%
UKRAINE HAVE ALWAYS BEEN

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:04.964 line:78%
OUTNUMBERED FROM THE DAY THEY

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.332 line:78%
ENTERED UKRAINE.

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.567 line:78%
THAT'S GOING TO CHANGE RATHER

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.768 line:78%
THAN DRAMATICALLY.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:12.072 line:78%
I SUSPECT THE BOMBERS THAT YOU

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:13.106 line:78%
REFERRED TO, WHO CARRY BOTH

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:14.474 line:78%
CONVENTIONAL OR NUCLEAR WEAPONS,

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.942 line:78%
WILL HAVE CONVENTIONAL ARMS, AND

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.744 line:78%
THOSE BOMBERS ARE PROBABLY GOING

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:19.345 line:78%
TO BE USED IN THE ESCALATION

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.679 line:78%
WE'RE ABOUT TO WITNESS IN

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:21.848 line:78%
UKRAINE.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:24.918 line:78%
I THINK HE'S GOING TO SETTLE

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:27.654 line:78%
THIS DISPUTE IN UKRAINE ON TERMS

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:29.322 line:78%
THAT ARE ACCEPTABLE TO RUSSIA

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:31.024 line:78%
THAT WE MAY NOT LIKE.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.692 line:78%
OTHER THAN POLAND, NO ONE IN

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.693 line:78%
NATO IS INTERESTED IN GOING TO

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:36.062 line:78%
WAR WITH RUSSIA.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:41.434 line:78%
IF WE PERSIST ON THIS LINE, WE

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:41.835 line:78%
WILL SEE NATO DISSOLVE AND

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.636 line:78%
FRAGMENT.

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:45.105 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Will: BECAUSE YOU'RE SAYING

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:47.607 line:78%
THEY WILL NOT FOLLOW POLAND'S

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:49.175 line:78%
LEAD, NOT STAND TO TOGETHER.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.809 line:78%
I ASSUME THAT'S WHAT YOU'RE

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.177 line:78%
SAYING, COLONEL?

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.746 line:78%
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE, ABSOLUTELY.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:54.547 line:78%
NO ONE WANTS TO GO TO WAR WITH

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:57.484 line:78%
RUSSIA, OTHER THAN THE POLES AND

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.485 line:78%
A FEW PEOPLE IN WASHINGTON, D.C.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.420 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Will: THAT WILL BE THE KEY.

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:03.022 line:78%
THAT WILL BE THE KEY, WHETHER OR

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:04.791 line:78%
NOT IF THE WORLD DOES NOT FOLLOW

